*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ADSC DIALOG DEFINITION      COMPANY CAR MENU
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD DIALOG FLEMENU VERSION 1
    DESCRIPTION IS 'COMPANY CAR MENU'
    SUBSCHEMA IS FLEETSS1 OF SCHEMA FLEETSCH VERSION 1
    MAP IS FLEMENUM VERSION 1
    WORK RECORD IS FLEWORK
    PREMAP PROCESS IS FLEMENU-PREMAP
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEMENU-ENTER  RESPONSE KEY IS ENTER
       EXECUTE ON EDIT ERRORS
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEMENU-PF3    RESPONSE KEY IS PF3
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEMENU-CLEAR  RESPONSE KEY IS CLEAR
    .
